{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/602b17b9628aab152f16103ec741e79e.avif?t=1758110157\" data-has-big width=1560 height=324 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mycelium: The Silent Contract</strong> is a haunting <strong>first-person</strong> action-adventure survival <strong>horror for 1-4 players</strong> set in a <strong>procedurally generated forest</strong>. Gather mysterious mycelium, survive against lurking threats, and escape before it\u2019s too late.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES IN THE DEMO</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play alone OR with up to 4 contractors</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Up to 15-minute-long missions and 3 unlockable cycles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Almost all monsters and locations\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playable tutorial</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2/9 equipment available</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>With this demo, we want you to feel the overall atmosphere of the game and try its mechanics. As your progress is limited to 3 cycles and you can play only up to 15 minutes, there will still be much more to discover in the full game!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Huge procedurally generated  forest with dynamic weather</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>20+ unique locations with their own mysteries</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>More than 10 monsters and other dangers to stand in your way</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 upgradable tools to aid in your missions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single and CO-OP multiplayer with an advanced voice chat and unusual means of communication</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MYCELIUM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no life after death but there's always more work to do. Having signed a contract in exchange for a successful life, now that it has ended, you are obliged to perform tasks for a company called Mycelium.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/cf8da640104e4e010ae952f6653fcd87.poster.avif?t=1758110157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/cf8da640104e4e010ae952f6653fcd87.webm?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/cf8da640104e4e010ae952f6653fcd87.mp4?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU ARRIVE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission you arrive at a dark and motionless forest where silence is your best friend. The forest is never the same, so you'll have to find your bearings over and over again. Don't get lost - or you might never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/5455bf5436dd5eb3e84ccda9c750bde1.poster.avif?t=1758110157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/5455bf5436dd5eb3e84ccda9c750bde1.webm?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/5455bf5436dd5eb3e84ccda9c750bde1.mp4?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU GATHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Look for mycelium as that's what you need to complete the contract and free your soul. Buy equipment the company provides and find valuables to get more time in the future missions. The more time you get, the more mysteries you can solve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/c997ceba336a2a390e11dec7b20d004b.poster.avif?t=1758110157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/c997ceba336a2a390e11dec7b20d004b.webm?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/c997ceba336a2a390e11dec7b20d004b.mp4?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU EXTRACT</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the mycelium you've got to extract from the mission. But hurry up - you can't stay in the forest forever. The longer you stay, the more dangerous it becomes, as there is always someone or something that wants your mycelium more than you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/8d110928afda7684f08616e241017ad0.poster.avif?t=1758110157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/8d110928afda7684f08616e241017ad0.webm?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/8d110928afda7684f08616e241017ad0.mp4?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WORK TOGETHER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They are not your friends, but other contractors may help you to speed things up. Take care of each other but always remember to take care of yourself first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/97d62735ef30ddd95489dee5df0eec53.poster.avif?t=1758110157\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/97d62735ef30ddd95489dee5df0eec53.webm?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/extras/97d62735ef30ddd95489dee5df0eec53.mp4?t=1758110157\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3999340?t=1758110157","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/7683e476f157a04db7454bfd6c57a5bb771279f7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758110157","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/b583ef596d2cc401817bfcd7a22dee0e4f59e7fd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758110157","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3999340/b583ef596d2cc401817bfcd7a22dee0e4f59e7fd/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758110157","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes